  L27#2: (a,b) with a^2=b^3=(ab)^7=1, [a,b] of order 4; [a-hat,b-hat] non-central, order 4
  L27#3: (a,b) with a^2=b^3=(ab)^7=1, [a,b] of order 4; [a-hat,b-hat] non-central, order 8
  L27#4: (a,b) with a^2=b^3=(ab)^7=1, [a,b] of order 4; [a-hat,b-hat] non-central, order 4
[PASS] 1b: YE1 (PSL(2,7)): for a (2,3,7)-generating pair in each witness, [a-hat,b-hat] is NON-central -- 'beta(a,b)' has no sign value either
  NOTE [P, cited]: IB's presentation <a,b | a^2, b^3, (ab)^7> is the
